<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SciClone begun at outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SciClone begun at outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities said Friday it began coverage of SciClone Pharmaceuticals Inc with an outperform rating, both intermediate and long-term, with an aggressive suitability.</p>
<p>-- SciClone's leading product is an immune enhancer for the treatment of chronic viral infections and cancers, EVEREN said.</p>
<p>-- Six-month price target is $16 and 18-month target is $24, EVEREN said in a research note.</p>
<p>--SciClone shares were up 1/4 at 5-1/4 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
